{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"气虚胃虚 - 标签","description":"这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。","home_page_url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://acuherb.xyz/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://acuherb.xyz/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"顺医法：论气虚胃虚","date_published":"2026-04-20T15:05:52&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-04-20T15:08:52&#43;08:00","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-3-shunyifa/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-3-shunyifa/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["气虚胃虚"],"summary":"本节为《石室秘录》“顺医法”部分，论述气虚胃虚之证治。核心思想是“顺其性而补之”，即顺应脾胃喜温恶湿、胃气下行之性，以补气健脾、分消水湿为法。","content_html":"本节为《石室秘录》“顺医法”部分，论述\u003cstrong\u003e气虚胃虚\u003c/strong\u003e之证治。核心思想是“\u003cstrong\u003e顺其性而补之\u003c/strong\u003e”，即顺应脾胃喜温恶湿、胃气下行之性，以补气健脾、分消水湿为法。"}]}